497 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (This book is not just written, it was taught and lived. I had the privilege of mentoring an exceptional team of young men and women over different times on certain onsite and online platforms. It is relevant parts of the content that we taught over the years at these platforms that were worked into the Wisdom for Living Book Series, of which this book is the first. I want to appreciate these uncommon proteges and everyone at the Wisdom Place, House of Insights, and other platforms, most of whom were the first set of students to learn the insights contained in the pages of this book. )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
498 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The importance of a purpose-driven team to any project cannot be overestimated. The resourceful team which kept me accountable, while doing their quota in ensuring the success of this book includes Precious Akintunde with whom I co-wrote this book. He has a lot of original ideas in various chapters of the book. The team of contributors and editors was led by Otiti Aburime  and includes Rachael Oyetade, Blessing Kayode, Ifejesu Majua Odejide and Precious Abayowa who also did the design of this book. Most of the team are also co-instructors with me at The Wisdom Place, The House of Insights and other platforms where I minister.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
