507 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In the journey of success, the adventures and experiences along the path are more beneficial and vital, oftentimes, than the perks of arrival at the destination. Thus, in the quest for success, the attributes and attitudes one develops and what one becomes due to the demands of the journey are more profound, lasting and beneficial than the things one acquires for getting to the destination. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
