509 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Wisdom of God is the foundation upon which the entire universe is built. Therefore, access to Divine Wisdom is like having the architect who designed the plans of a very complex mansion to show one around the building. One can not miss the way when the designer of the blueprint is also the guide.  )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
