/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (This book focuses on Wisdom particularly in the context of achieving success in your life, vision, and destiny. The principles outlined are both straightforward and deep, rooted in God's Word. The insights shared in this book aim to motivate, push boundaries, spark creativity, and illuminate the path for you to reach your full potential.)
/E (This book focuses on Wisdom particularly in the context of achieving success in your life, vision, and destiny. The principles outlined are both straightforward and deep, rooted in God's Word. The insights shared in this book aim to motivate, push boundaries, spark creativity, and illuminate the path for you to reach your full potential.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
