521 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Self discovery is the prerequisite for success and fulfillment in life. However, the concept of self-discovery has been largely misunderstood. The popular talk about self-discovery, especially among secular speakers and environments many times, leaves people more confused than oriented. This is because many of the self-help theorems and strategies postulated seek to fix from outside an issue that need to be addressed from the inner self.  To really understand the concept of self-discovery, we need to go back to the first reference to the human-self in scriptures. In Gen 1:26-27, God said,)
/E (Self discovery is the prerequisite for success and fulfillment in life. However, the concept of self-discovery has been largely misunderstood. The popular talk about self-discovery, especially among secular speakers and environments many times, leaves people more confused than oriented. This is because many of the self-help theorems and strategies postulated seek to fix from outside an issue that need to be addressed from the inner self.  To really understand the concept of self-discovery, we need to go back to the first reference to the human-self in scriptures. In Gen 1:26-27, God said,)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
