531 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (You are the image and likeness of God - this is your identity. Of course, the image and likeness of God is infinite and can not be holistically expressed by human. Thus, God deposits a dimension and revelation of Himself into everything He created to reveal. Even inanimate objects have a particular revelation of God that are given to reveal \(see Psa 19: 1-4, Rom 1: 19 - 20\). )
/E (You are the image and likeness of God - this is your identity. Of course, the image and likeness of God is infinite and can not be holistically expressed by human. Thus, God deposits a dimension and revelation of Himself into everything He created to reveal. Even inanimate objects have a particular revelation of God that are given to reveal \(see Psa 19: 1-4, Rom 1: 19 - 20\). )
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
