<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Every human is different and are all created in the image and likeness of God. This does not mean that God has multiple identities like one suffering from identity crises, this rather shows that God is multi-dimensional and every of His child is to display a dimension of God. )
/E (Every human is different and are all created in the image and likeness of God. This does not mean that God has multiple identities like one suffering from identity crises, this rather shows that God is multi-dimensional and every of His child is to display a dimension of God. )
