/T (This understanding explains why two different people can be learning about God, reading the same Bible, being taught by same teachers under the same conditions, seeking God under the same environments, but are seeing different realities about God. This also explains why it is unwise to make the entire pursuit of your life being or doing what someone else is or doing, in a comparative or competitive way.)
