/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T ( A teacher seeks God and finds doctrines, a business person seeks God and finds practical business principles, a preacher seeks God and sees sermons, and a musician seeks God and sees lyrics overflowing in melodies, an intercessor seeks God and sees prayer points, a leader/political inclined person seeks God and finds governance. An inventor seeks God and finds creativity. A thought leader seeks God and finds ideas. God is so vast and no one can know all of Him and all about Him. A good way to know who you are is to devote yourself to seeking God and see the revelations that He gives you about yourself. God in His sovereignty actually supervises the revelation of Himself that each person gets and makes it to be according to the uniqueness of His assignment and destiny for them. Thus, to discover yourself, first become connected to God through faith in Jesus Christ, then decide to be and celebrate what God created you to be. Also, be determined not to be intimidated in appreciating the importance of the dimension of God you represent. )
/E ( A teacher seeks God and finds doctrines, a business person seeks God and finds practical business principles, a preacher seeks God and sees sermons, and a musician seeks God and sees lyrics overflowing in melodies, an intercessor seeks God and sees prayer points, a leader/political inclined person seeks God and finds governance. An inventor seeks God and finds creativity. A thought leader seeks God and finds ideas. God is so vast and no one can know all of Him and all about Him. A good way to know who you are is to devote yourself to seeking God and see the revelations that He gives you about yourself. God in His sovereignty actually supervises the revelation of Himself that each person gets and makes it to be according to the uniqueness of His assignment and destiny for them. Thus, to discover yourself, first become connected to God through faith in Jesus Christ, then decide to be and celebrate what God created you to be. Also, be determined not to be intimidated in appreciating the importance of the dimension of God you represent. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
540 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Thereafter, be committed to seeking God and discovering Him. The only way to truly discover and know yourself is by seeking and knowing God. When you seek God, you find yourself. In other words, when you seek God, you find the particular dimension of Him that pertains to your destiny. The secret of self confidence and self esteem is loving, appreciating, celebrating and believing in the importance of the dimension of God that you represent on earth.)
/E (Thereafter, be committed to seeking God and discovering Him. The only way to truly discover and know yourself is by seeking and knowing God. When you seek God, you find yourself. In other words, when you seek God, you find the particular dimension of Him that pertains to your destiny. The secret of self confidence and self esteem is loving, appreciating, celebrating and believing in the importance of the dimension of God that you represent on earth.)
