/T (Point three; thus, a holistic understanding of true success and self-fulfillment, which is the aim of this volume, makes one realize that many of the who are the reference points for material success without self-discovery and self-actualization in God have neither truly discovered self nor really succeeded. They have only material wealth and human perception of success through compliance with the principles of value, productivity, impact and wealth. True success and self-actualization, when all is said and done, cannot be totally appraised on this side of eternity.)
