603 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Definitions are always the first basis for clarifying and understanding any concept. At all levels of schooling, whenever a topic is to be taught, the teacher starts by giving a working definition of it. A good and simple definition makes a concept well-understood, clear, easily relatable and applicable. A vital part of understanding, discovering and maximising your life purpose is to have a working definition of your life. A life of impact starts with a clear and concise definition.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
604 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Self Definition is mentally articulating, verbally or textually expressing what you believe your life is all about. Self-Definition is defining in clear terms who you are and what you life is about. Self-discovery and accurate self-perception should be followed by a succinct self-definition. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
