623 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T ( It is not something you window-shop for, but God gives to you out at His volition as you devote yourself to loving, seeking and walking with Him. In fact, if you are staying with God because you want Him to give you a Life Scripture that you can run away with, He most certainly will not attend to you yet. So, walk with God, fellowship and love Him, but stay open and release your faith for the scriptures or words that define your destiny now that you understand there is such a tool in God. Also, by all means, do not cook one or assume one for yourself. If you do, you will not see it manifest. God only confirms the Word He spoke, not the Word you assumed He spoke. )
/E ( It is not something you window-shop for, but God gives to you out at His volition as you devote yourself to loving, seeking and walking with Him. In fact, if you are staying with God because you want Him to give you a Life Scripture that you can run away with, He most certainly will not attend to you yet. So, walk with God, fellowship and love Him, but stay open and release your faith for the scriptures or words that define your destiny now that you understand there is such a tool in God. Also, by all means, do not cook one or assume one for yourself. If you do, you will not see it manifest. God only confirms the Word He spoke, not the Word you assumed He spoke. )
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [0]
>>
