638 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Find a quiet place and think about your life and develop an essential definition for it. It is vital that your Life Statement is well articulated and written down. An unwritten Life Statement is simply non-existent, no matter how clearly it is conceived. It is also noteworthy that a single statement as the ones listed above may not come so easily for you. So, do not be too yoked with unnecessary perfectionism in crafting a life statement. Just write what you believe best describes what you know about your assignment for now and start working with what you have. Life has a way of unfolding when one is moving. Whatever you are able to write right now will do the great job of getting you started. )
/E (Find a quiet place and think about your life and develop an essential definition for it. It is vital that your Life Statement is well articulated and written down. An unwritten Life Statement is simply non-existent, no matter how clearly it is conceived. It is also noteworthy that a single statement as the ones listed above may not come so easily for you. So, do not be too yoked with unnecessary perfectionism in crafting a life statement. Just write what you believe best describes what you know about your assignment for now and start working with what you have. Life has a way of unfolding when one is moving. Whatever you are able to write right now will do the great job of getting you started. )
