643 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Of course, the Life Statement does not describe all one will do in life,  but rather it provides a pivot around which all one does revolves. A great number of people are confused about life and purpose because they think that life purpose talks about an action, activity, job, profession, career or path. No! life statement assignment and purpose talk foremost about the mindset and consciousness which should be brought into the actions, activities, jobs, businesses, practices, careers or paths you engage. So, your Life Statement is not describing the one thing you will do with your life, rather, it portrays the mindset and understanding that governs and powers all the things you will do in life. Life will place many demands and needs, changing roles and tasks, different paths and multiple activities on you at different phases of you life. However, as you do all the different things at the different phases of life as occasion demands, your life statement should governs your attitude and conviction about yourself and your life in all that you do. Thereby, it provides the fulcrum around which your life revolves and stabilizes irrespective of changing scenarios.  )
/E (Of course, the Life Statement does not describe all one will do in life,  but rather it provides a pivot around which all one does revolves. A great number of people are confused about life and purpose because they think that life purpose talks about an action, activity, job, profession, career or path. No! life statement assignment and purpose talk foremost about the mindset and consciousness which should be brought into the actions, activities, jobs, businesses, practices, careers or paths you engage. So, your Life Statement is not describing the one thing you will do with your life, rather, it portrays the mindset and understanding that governs and powers all the things you will do in life. Life will place many demands and needs, changing roles and tasks, different paths and multiple activities on you at different phases of you life. However, as you do all the different things at the different phases of life as occasion demands, your life statement should governs your attitude and conviction about yourself and your life in all that you do. Thereby, it provides the fulcrum around which your life revolves and stabilizes irrespective of changing scenarios.  )
/Pg 41 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
