/T (Life Core Values must also be written down. When Life Values are not predetermined and predefined, one will not be able to take a firm stand at some crucial points when life presents conflicting alternatives, compromising choices without prior notice. A lot of people make decisions or take alternatives which they later regret and wish they had not taken. Having Core Values that have been practiced over years, helps constitute a strong and sometimes, semi-conscious solid-cast mental system for decision making in daily living. )
