690 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (A vivid example of this is in respiration, where plants breathe in carbon dioxide to give off oxygen, which is taken in by animals to give off carbon dioxide; which is in turn breathed in by the plants. Also, in the biological system of living things, every part of the body has a function it plays in the overall functionality. The vitality of the heart, lungs, legs, hands and major organs are unquestionable, but even seemingly insignificant parts have an assignment in the body. Do you know that the hair on our body plays a role in insulation against heat and the eyebrows keeps sweat of the eyes? Even the appendix which has been said to play no role in the anatomy have been discovered by experts to have served a role when human diet was mostly vegetarian. Furthermore, more recent research has shown that the appendix currently plays a role in the human immune system. Nothing is created without purpose. God is very intentional and detailed. He who creates seemingly insignificant things for specific purposes and assignments, will definitely have a purpose for man, the height of His creation, who was created in his image and likeness.  )
/E (A vivid example of this is in respiration, where plants breathe in carbon dioxide to give off oxygen, which is taken in by animals to give off carbon dioxide; which is in turn breathed in by the plants. Also, in the biological system of living things, every part of the body has a function it plays in the overall functionality. The vitality of the heart, lungs, legs, hands and major organs are unquestionable, but even seemingly insignificant parts have an assignment in the body. Do you know that the hair on our body plays a role in insulation against heat and the eyebrows keeps sweat of the eyes? Even the appendix which has been said to play no role in the anatomy have been discovered by experts to have served a role when human diet was mostly vegetarian. Furthermore, more recent research has shown that the appendix currently plays a role in the human immune system. Nothing is created without purpose. God is very intentional and detailed. He who creates seemingly insignificant things for specific purposes and assignments, will definitely have a purpose for man, the height of His creation, who was created in his image and likeness.  )
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
