/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (From Adam and Eve, to every person thereafter, there is an existent need each person is assigned to fill. Gen 1: 26 is the scripture where man was mentioned for the first time in the Bible and it is in reference with an assignment. It reads, God said, Let us make man in our image, after our likeness: and let them have dominion over the fish of the sea, and over the fowl of the air, and over the cattle, and over all the earth, and over every creeping thing that creepeth upon the earth \(Gen 1:26\). )
