/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (There are three central themes around a viable life assignment. They include God, a task, and a people. Thinking around these three themes bring clarity to your life assignment. Your life assignment is all about the task God sent you towards a particular people. )
/E (There are three central themes around a viable life assignment. They include God, a task, and a people. Thinking around these three themes bring clarity to your life assignment. Your life assignment is all about the task God sent you towards a particular people. )
