743 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (The truth is that God can give you an assignment in an area where you do not seem particularly to be gifted for and/or send you to a place you do not have a passion to go. We have seen preachers that are not good orators and business tycoons who do not seem smart. God loves to give people assignments that make you always need Him and sends you to a place where you will always be dependent on Him. Therefore, He can give you things you seem not to be naturally gifted for to do. This is the reason in identifying the Life Assignment, seeking God, not seeking pointers, is premium. A formula, recipe or equation promulgated by people for assignment discovery will not work, only the Spirit of God can lead you into your life assignment. )
/E (The truth is that God can give you an assignment in an area where you do not seem particularly to be gifted for and/or send you to a place you do not have a passion to go. We have seen preachers that are not good orators and business tycoons who do not seem smart. God loves to give people assignments that make you always need Him and sends you to a place where you will always be dependent on Him. Therefore, He can give you things you seem not to be naturally gifted for to do. This is the reason in identifying the Life Assignment, seeking God, not seeking pointers, is premium. A formula, recipe or equation promulgated by people for assignment discovery will not work, only the Spirit of God can lead you into your life assignment. )
