763 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (You were created to work. Your purpose is linked to your work. Purpose discovery is work not a feeling. A lot of people pray for discovery of their assignments, attend classes and teachings on purpose discovery and do every other thing, except investing themselves in a profitable work venture. Such people never discover anything, no matter how hard they pray and meditate in the Spirit. In self-discovery, working at something as vital as, praying, meditating or even reading relevant books. Even if what you start working at is not ultimately your specific assignment, working triggers the mechanism for the intelligence of God to lead you into the specifics of your assignment. It is easier to turn the wheels of a moving vehicle than a stationary one. )
/E (You were created to work. Your purpose is linked to your work. Purpose discovery is work not a feeling. A lot of people pray for discovery of their assignments, attend classes and teachings on purpose discovery and do every other thing, except investing themselves in a profitable work venture. Such people never discover anything, no matter how hard they pray and meditate in the Spirit. In self-discovery, working at something as vital as, praying, meditating or even reading relevant books. Even if what you start working at is not ultimately your specific assignment, working triggers the mechanism for the intelligence of God to lead you into the specifics of your assignment. It is easier to turn the wheels of a moving vehicle than a stationary one. )
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [2]
>>
