/T ( An intrapreneur enjoys the benefits of entrepreneurship within a larger organisation, thereby absolving him of the risk associated with him starting up a company. When an organisation systemically allows its workers to apply an entrepreneurial mindset to their job within a company, it s using intrapreneurial techniques. It is important to know how to be an intrapreneur within an organisation and also important for leaders to know how to develop an intrapreneurial mindset and not merely an employee mindset in their workers. )
