/T (It is most crucial for those that have a job that is not specifically their life assignment to still exert themselves in a work that is their life assignment. This could be a for profit, non-profit, ministry-related work or an investment portfolio you are building to enable you do the things that matter to your life and destiny later. Get involved in something that you know is the essence and purpose of your life while you are still at that job that you know is not the entire essence of your life. )
