<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (As usually said, one could fall into a ditch on either side of the road. One extreme  is found in those that pursue survival and security in life,  with no thought of the higher purpose of Life Assignment. The other extreme is found in people who have become irresponsible and unrealistic with everyday life and do nothing to make a decent living for self-dependence in the name of pursuing something higher with their lives.  There has been a noted trend of pragmatic irresponsibility with working to meet up with the everyday expenditure and demands of life, among those who seem to have a particular passion thay see as the essence of their lives. )
