805 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (There have been people who believe their life assignment is related  to a particular expression of art, music, sport, passion or spiritual ministry and they literally become irresponsible in every other area of life except the singular activity of that vocation. This in itself is a gross misconception of life assignment. I was particularly pained once when I met on the streets, one of my seniors in the university who we knew to be very given to spiritual pursuits to the exclusion of academics and regular work some years after I had graduated. He walked to me, gave me a spiritual greeting and talked about how he came for a church meeting in town and needed money to get back to his base.  I respected his spiritual passion, but I knew he could be as passionate for spiritual things as he was and still take responsibility in other areas of life. I gave him some money because I knew and trusted him.)
/E (There have been people who believe their life assignment is related  to a particular expression of art, music, sport, passion or spiritual ministry and they literally become irresponsible in every other area of life except the singular activity of that vocation. This in itself is a gross misconception of life assignment. I was particularly pained once when I met on the streets, one of my seniors in the university who we knew to be very given to spiritual pursuits to the exclusion of academics and regular work some years after I had graduated. He walked to me, gave me a spiritual greeting and talked about how he came for a church meeting in town and needed money to get back to his base.  I respected his spiritual passion, but I knew he could be as passionate for spiritual things as he was and still take responsibility in other areas of life. I gave him some money because I knew and trusted him.)
