811 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (There have been people who believe they are called to be musicians, who do not take their academics serious, do not take their finances serious, are not willing to work at a job or build a business, but just want  to sing and rehearse all day long. They are not equipped and prepared to meet the demands of everyday life. So, though they are excellent singers and musician, they still live deficient lives. It is most painful when this is done by people who believe they are called into the ministry and only want to do spiritual things all day long and become irresponsible in other areas of life. It is a misunderstanding of life assignment that misrepresents God. People look at them and ridicule God, not knowing that He is not happy with how they are living. God can sincerely call one into ministry, but at the same time the wisdom to know how to go about it takes adequate teaching, training and mentoring. )
/E (There have been people who believe they are called to be musicians, who do not take their academics serious, do not take their finances serious, are not willing to work at a job or build a business, but just want  to sing and rehearse all day long. They are not equipped and prepared to meet the demands of everyday life. So, though they are excellent singers and musician, they still live deficient lives. It is most painful when this is done by people who believe they are called into the ministry and only want to do spiritual things all day long and become irresponsible in other areas of life. It is a misunderstanding of life assignment that misrepresents God. People look at them and ridicule God, not knowing that He is not happy with how they are living. God can sincerely call one into ministry, but at the same time the wisdom to know how to go about it takes adequate teaching, training and mentoring. )
